data: {"id": "638cf805cd5140e4-final", "run_id": "638cf805cd5140e4", "seq": 1888, "ts_ms": 1788446855297, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态，重启13次，容器进程因应用层错误连续非正常退出。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx` 处于 `Running`，容器 `app` 重启 13 次，最后终止原因为 `Error`，退出码 `78` | 确认应用进程持续非正常退出的直接表现 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning BackOff` 97s (x202 over 46m)：`Back-off restarting failed container app` | 确认崩溃已持续约 46 分钟且触发指数退避 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubernetes | 容器 `app` 内存 Limit `96Mi`，Request `24Mi`；CPU Limit `200m`，Request `20m` | 资源规格上下文：内存配置较紧，但退出码非 OOMKill |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` = 13 (标签 `container: app`)；`status_last_terminated_reason` 持续为 1 (标签 `reason: Error`) | 量化重启次数及终止原因模式为 `Error` |\n| 5 | Logging | elasticsearch | `http_request` ERROR 模式出现 8 次：`message: \"CONFIG_MISSING\"`，`http_status: 500`，`path: \"/work\"` (2026-09-03 14:16 - 14:42) | 捕获触发崩溃的具体错误模式与业务路径 |\n| 6 | Tracing | tempo | `GET /work` Span (e.g., trace `9e99fbd9...`, `da9999ae...`)，属性 `aiops.observed_mode: config_missing_exit`，响应 500 | 链路追踪确认异常发生在特定业务调用栈中 |\n\n**证据印证说明：**\n- **编号 1、2、4** 共同证实了 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态及其高频率重启特征，`Exit Code 78` 指向非系统信号（如 OOM）导致的进程终止。\n- **编号 3** 排除了因资源硬限制（OOM）导致退出码为 137 的可能性，且内存 Limit `96Mi` 与退出码 `78` 无直接关联。\n- **编号 5、6** 直接锁定了崩溃机制：应用在处理 `/work` 接口时，因 `CONFIG_MISSING` 触发业务逻辑异常（500），随后进程以代码 78 退出。Tracing 的 `config_missing_exit` 模式与日志的 `CONFIG_MISSING` 相互印证。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用运行环境缺少必要配置项 (CONFIG_MISSING) → 处理 /work 请求时触发业务逻辑异常 (HTTP 500) → 进程非正常退出 (Exit Code 78) → K8s 容器重启机制进入 CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是：**应用代码在运行环境中缺失关键配置项（`CONFIG_MISSING`），导致在处理 HTTP 请求（`/work`）时触发未处理或退出的业务异常，使容器进程以退出码 78 终止。**\n\n**依据：**\n- **K8s 事实 (Fact #1, #2)** 显示容器持续以 `Error` 状态退出并触发 `CrashLoopBackOff`。\n- **Logging 事实 (Fact #5)** 和 **Tracing 事实 (Fact #6)** 明确捕获到 `CONFIG_MISSING` 错误模式及 `aiops.observed_mode: config_missing_exit` 的链路标记，且时间范围与崩溃周期吻合。\n- **Metric 事实 (Fact #4)** 确认了终止原因为 `Error` 且重启次数达 13 次，排除了瞬时故障。\n\n**缺失信息：**\n- 缺失具体的配置项 Key 名称，无法进一步定位配置中心或 ConfigMap 的具体错误源。\n- 退出码 78 对应的具体业务含义未被当前事实定义覆盖。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 16.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 125.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx: 125.1s (Evidence 114.1s, RCA 10.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 14.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- 未调用 Runbook\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 155.207, "metrics": {"run_id": "638cf805cd5140e4", "mttr": {"value": "2.6m", "seconds": 155.21391987800598, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "40%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": false, "runbook_id": null, "pass": false, "score": 0.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.045, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "未匹配"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.95, "weighted_score": 0.19, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 95%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 155213.91987800598, "llm_calls": 16, "llm_duration_ms": 97917.98758506775, "tool_calls": 21, "executed_tool_calls": 21, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 20, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 112623.01731109619, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 56709.31911468506}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 16041.768312454224, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 125093.42455863953, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 14054.985046386719, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

